    "brand_manifesto": {
      "type": "fruttita-prose",
      "blocks": {
        "m_p1": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "在非洲热带草原的深处，伫立着一种古老的植物——猴面包树。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "In the African savanna, there's a tree that's been standing for 3,000 years. The baobab.",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "Na savana africana, existe uma árvore de pé há 3.000 anos. O embondeiro."
          }
        },
        "m_p2": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "它们沉默地守望着这片红土地，历经干旱与烈日，却能在体内储存数吨的水源。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "It survives drought, extreme heat, and centuries of neglect — storing tons of water in its trunk.",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "Sobrevive à seca, ao calor extremo e a séculos de abandono — armazenando toneladas de água no tronco."
          }
        },
        "m_p3": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "它们不依赖人工催熟，只是在枝头沐浴着赤道阳光自然风干，锁住了大自然最原本的生命力。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "Its fruit ripens on the branch. No one picks it early. No one sprays it. It just dries in the sun.",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "O fruto amadurece no ramo. Ninguém o colhe cedo. Ninguém o pulveriza. Seca ao sol."
          }
        },
        "m_p4": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "这是一种纯粹的野性。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "That's wildness you can't manufacture.",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "Isso é uma pureza que não se fabrica."
          }
        },
        "m_p5": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "而身处现代都市的我们，生活被精加工的食物、嘈杂的信息和无形的压力填满。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "Meanwhile, we fill our days with ultra-processed food, screen fatigue, and stress we barely notice.",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "Entretanto, enchemos os nossos dias com comida ultraprocessada, fadiga de ecrã e stress que mal notamos."
          }
        },
        "m_p6": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "我们像上了发条的钟表，追逐效率，却常常忘记了身体最本能的渴望。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "We optimize everything except what we put in our bodies.",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "Otimizamos tudo exceto o que pomos no corpo."
          }
        },
        "m_p7": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "我们要的，或许不是更多的添加，而是回归与恢复。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "Maybe the answer isn't adding more. Maybe it's starting simpler.",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "Talvez a resposta não seja adicionar mais. Talvez seja começar mais simples."
          }
        },
        "m_p8": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "Fruttita 的诞生，源于一个简单的愿望：把那份来自热带旷野的“干净”和“野”，带进你的日常。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "That's why Fruttita exists. One fruit. Barely processed. Brought to you.",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "É por isso que a Fruttita existe. Um fruto. Quase intocado. Até ti."
          }
        }
      },
