          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "我们不定义什么是“健康的生活”。我们只是提供一个 0 负担的天然选项——让你在都市的节奏里，找回最舒服的状态。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "We don't define healthy. We just make something with one ingredient, zero sodium, and no fine print — so the choice is easy when you want it to be.",
